Agree with Peter, and I'd suggest extending this beyond Apache. Any 
project sending say more than two or three advisories in a day could 
consolidate them into a single digest, with links to the relevant 
entries in the usual vulnerability databases (NVD, GHSA, the project's 
own advisory pages, etc). That would keep the list readable while still 
giving anyone who cares a quick path to the details.

